# Platform Core — очередь агентов (planner)

When `dev:core` is running on `:3001`, agents **must** pull work from the live planner queue (not ad-hoc scope).

## API (development only)

| Method | Path | Action |
|--------|------|--------|
| GET | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner` | Full snapshot + statuses |
| GET | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/next` | Next open task (P0 first) |
| POST | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/claim` | `{ "by": "cursor-agent", "id?": "..." }` → in_progress |
| POST | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/run-agents` | Claim + dispatch prompt → `.planning/platform-core-agent-dispatch.json` |
| POST | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/analyze` | Honest scan → up to 10 new items (dev + tech-debt) |
| POST | `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/complete` | `{ "id": "...", "by": "...", "note?": "..." }` → done |

Runtime state: `_ai-share/synth-1-full/.planning/platform-core-planner-runtime.json`

## Agent workflow

0. **Start:** `_platform-core-split/platform-core/CURSOR-START-HERE.md` — не `@/lib/routes`; readiness — **один** `*-audit.ts`.
1. Ensure `npm run dev:core` (`GET /api/dev/syntha-status`).
2. `npm run validate:platform-core-boundary`.
3. `npm run planner:analyze` если `open` ≈ 0 (до +10 задач).
4. `npm run planner:next` → pillar → **syntha-*** subagent (routing table ниже).
5. Implement **only** claimed task; gateways: `src/lib/platform-core-gateways/`.
6. Verify (lint / smoke touched area).
7. `npm run planner:complete -- <id> "note"`.
8. Repeat while `open` &gt; 0.

## UI

Hub `/platform` → tab **План** — polls every 5s; **Агенты · online** when API reachable.

**UI buttons:**
- **▶ Запустить агентов (чат)** — claim + **Cursor SDK local agent** + live chat panel (poll `/api/dev/platform-core/planner/session/{id}`)
- Requires: `npm run planner:agent:install` + `CURSOR_API_KEY` in `.env.local` (cursor.com/dashboard/integrations)
- **🔍 Проанализировать (+10)** — section audit gaps + code TODO/stub scan (no LLM hype)
- Per-row **▶ Агентам** — claim that task + open chat

## CLI (from monorepo root)

Запускайте **по одной строке** (без `#` в той же строке — npm воспримет как аргумент):

```bash
npm run core:status
npm run core:restart
npm run dev:core
npm run planner:agent:setup
npm run planner:agent:loop
npm run planner:next
npm run planner:claim
npm run planner:complete -- <task-id> "note"
```

`CURSOR_API_KEY` — в `_ai-share/synth-1-full/.env.local` (не в командной строке).

Если `:3001` занят не Platform Core: `npm run core:restart` или `npm run stop:stale-dev`.

## Pillar × role → preferred backend agent (routing hints)

| Pillar | Brand | Shop | Manufacturer | Supplier |
|--------|-------|------|--------------|----------|
| development | product_architect, tech_debt | — | product_architect | — |
| sample_collection | product_architect, content | product_architect | — | — |
| collection_order | risk | order_anomaly, risk | — | — |
| order_production | — | — | order_anomaly, tech_debt | order_anomaly, risk |
| comms | architecture_guard | architecture_guard | — | — |

Source: `app/agents/hub_agent_routing.py` + `stack_routing.py` + `stack_registry.py`.

Live API:
`GET /api/v1/platform/stack/agents/routing?pillar=&role=&section_id=&task=`

Returns `preferred_agent`, `section_hint`, `cursor_subagent`, `hub_matrix` (when no filters).

## Adding manual items

Edit `src/lib/platform-core-planner-agent.ts` → `PLATFORM_CORE_PLANNER_AGENT_ITEMS`.

## Domain Cursor subagents (SYNTHA)

| Subagent | Scope |
|----------|--------|
| `syntha-w2-development` | Pillar 1 — артикулы, workshop2, ТЗ, образец |
| `syntha-sample-collection` | Pillar 2 — лайншиты, showroom, сезон коллекции |
| `syntha-b2b-order` | Pillar 3 — матрица, checkout, registry, tracking |
| `syntha-factory-production` | Pillar 4 — PO, handoff, procurement, materials |
| `syntha-platform-core-e2e` | Playwright core-* specs, core:verify |
| `syntha-comms` | Pillar 5 — JWT, users, order chat, calendar |
| `syntha-agent-ops` | Router — pillar/section → backend + subagent + planner |

Files: `.cursor/agents/syntha-*.md` — invoke via Task tool or «Use syntha-w2-development subagent».

Intel map: `npm run agent:intel:refresh` → `.planning/intel/agents-map.md`

## Eval packs

- Routing (no LLM): `npm run agent:eval:routing`
- Ollama smoke: `npm run agent:eval:ollama` → `.planning/intel/ollama-eval-report.md` (qwen3 preferred)
- Full eval: `npm run agent:eval:all` (intel map + routing + ollama)
- Intel map: `npm run agent:intel:refresh` → `.planning/intel/agents-map.md`
- Full codebase intel: `/gsd-intel refresh`

## Backend orchestrator (FastAPI)

- Registry: `app/agents/registry.py`
- Wired agents: scan (`tech_debt`, `architecture_guard`, `code_quality`, `ui_improvement`, `ai_module_curator`, `feature_suggestion`) + LLM (`order_anomaly`, …) in `orchestrator_agent.py`
- Context normalizer: `app/agents/platform_context.py` → `enrich_platform_context()` on `POST /api/v1/ai/task`
- Platform Core dev bridge: `POST /api/dev/platform-ai/task` → FastAPI `POST /api/v1/ai/task/dev` (development only)
- UI: `PlatformAiTaskStrip` on brand registry (`brand-co-registry-ai-anomaly`)
- UI: matrix quota (`shop-co-matrix-quota-ai`), shop registry (`shop-co-registry-ai-anomaly`), handoff (`mfr-op-handoff-queue-ai-anomaly`)
